  "source": "ggen v5 unit-only criteria (ER access, UR tag weights, SP/SSP power baselines, neutral buckets)",
  "notes": [
    "v5: buckets Recommended / Solid / Situational / Niche",
    "v5: units only focus; pilots deferred (pilot tables retained dormant)",
    "v5: ER Expert eligible-stage count axis",
    "v5: strategic tag value from Limited UR 1.5 / permanent UR 1.0 weights",
    "v5: separate SP vs SSP weapon power bands",
    "v5: MAP ammo + effect-range cell coverage (cap +3)",
    "v5: weapon condition tiers (Low HP=0; strong conditions up to +2)",
    "v5: terrain missing Space/Land -3; Sea extra; perfect-coverage bonus",
    "Suggestion-list philosophy: strictly-better extras matter; close letters need human judgment.",
    "v5.1: pilots scored with ER access + strategic tag UR weights + rarity adj",
    "v5.1: large footprint (OccupiedAreaId 2) small positioning tax on Atk/Sup",
    "v5.1: EX weapons intentionally not scored (UR-only / not an SP-SSP concern)",
    "v5.1: separate pilot_letter_cutoffs (kit scores run hotter than unit totals)",
    "v5.2: unit/pilot kits scored from TraitTypeIndex / CharacterSkillTraitType (not regex)",
    "v5.2: movement follow-up from structured Chance Step / PostAttackMove types",
    "v5.2: EN cost not scored",
    "v5.3: weapon Debuff TargetValue→m_trait kind/magnitude; rare range-down structured",
    "v5.3: ability/skill magnitude bands; public TraitType point tables in criteria",
    "v5.4: MAP presence (+1 any MAP) + dash/MovingAttack (+1); ammo 2+ extra; coverage from dash path; axis cap +4",
    "v5.4: practical rebalance — softer ER floor penalty, strategic-tag cap 2, movement-followup stacks to +2"
  ],
